@UmamusumeRag.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5033

### Health check
GET {{UmamusumeRag.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### List ingested documents
GET {{UmamusumeRag.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents
Accept: application/json

### Ingest everything under ./data (chunk -> embed -> store)
POST {{UmamusumeRag.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents/ingest

### Re-ingest everything, even if unchanged
POST {{UmamusumeRag.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents/ingest?force=true

### Ingest a custom folder
POST {{UmamusumeRag.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents/ingest?path=/absolute/path/to/docs

### Upload a single file (multipart/form-data)
POST {{UmamusumeRag.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----UmamusumeRagBoundary

------UmamusumeRagBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample-umamusume-overview.md"
Content-Type: text/markdown

< ../../data/sample-umamusume-overview.md
------UmamusumeRagBoundary--

### Ask a question (embed -> retrieve -> generate)
POST {{UmamusumeRag.Api_HostAddress}}/api/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What is the URA Finals?",
  "topK": 5
}

### Delete a document (replace the id with one from GET /api/documents)
DELETE {{UmamusumeRag.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
